<title>USA: Cowen says cuts EPS view on Cyrix Corp.</title>
<headline>Cowen says cuts EPS view on Cyrix Corp.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said it cut its 1996 earnings per share view for Cyrix Corp by $0.49 to a loss of $1.89 and its 1997 estimate by $1.20 to a loss of $0.51.</p>
<p>Cowen said it kept the stock rated neutral.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The stock was down 13/16 at 13-7/8 on Wednesday morning.</p>
